Rāma lectures Khara on reaping evil like seasonal fruit --- Rāma vows arrows will pierce Khara like snakes anthill --- Rāma promises sages will watch Khara fall hellward --- Khara mocks boasting as mark of common warriors --- Khara claims mace can slay Rāma like Death itself --- Khara hurls blazing mace burning trees and shrubs --- Rāma shreds skyborne mace into fragments with arrows